# Projects `/projects`

- Project CRUD and detail. Required: name, selected companyId, startDate, dueDate. Server validates the selected Company.
- Interpret and persist Project calendar dates and timestamps using the system default timezone `Asia/Bangkok`; do not convert persisted timestamps to UTC.
- Counts from `WorkItem`. Hours = SUM(`TimeEntry.hours`) without duplicated joins. Progress = completed ÷ (total − cancelled); do not treat stored `progress` as independent truth unless kept in sync.
- Summarize `WorkItem.role` (Developer / Infra / SA). Do not present `_count.members` or `project-team-modal` as a product feature.
- Filters: status, Company, and text. Detail lists Work Items, roles, and hours with real foreign keys.
- Delete/archive must warn about WorkItems/TimeEntries. Schema currently cascades — block accidental history loss. Confirm-delete is an alert dialog.
- Company rollout: nullable FK → attach every existing Project to Dhas → no orphans → NOT NULL. New Projects select an existing Company ID that the server validates.
- Dialogs use `DIALOG_SHELL_SCROLL_CLASS` and opaque `bg-card`. List and detail use `PAGE_MAIN`.
- Out: CRM, invoices, budget ledger as source of truth, Kanban on this route, or a Customer registry.
- Budget/spent stay visible only if defined and maintained.
